WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:07.388
To build a bot yourself, tap New bot, then "💬 Chat bot".

2
00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:09.500
Pick a starting point.

3
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.991
Let's take "🎁 Free gift from my ad".

4
00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:14.339
Here is your first message.

5
00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:16.467
Change the words to your own.

6
00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:18.786
Paste the link to your gift.

7
00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:21.443
Then tap "🔘 Add a button", for your channel.

8
00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:31.796
Tap Change to pick when the next message comes: right away, after a wait, or when they tap a button.

9
00:00:32.905 --> 00:00:35.261
Write the follow-up in your own words.

10
00:00:35.391 --> 00:00:37.326
Don't need message 3?

11
00:00:37.456 --> 00:00:39.598
Tap the bin 🗑, then "Delete".

12
00:00:39.898 --> 00:00:41.865
Now add a special step.

13
00:00:41.995 --> 00:00:45.172
Tap "Add the next message", then "❓ Ask a question".

14
00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:48.281
Write your question, like: What's your email?

15
00:00:48.411 --> 00:00:50.911
Then pick the kind of answer, "📧 Email".

16
00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:53.024
Or ask for a phone number.

17
00:00:53.324 --> 00:00:57.077
Tap the arrow, so the question comes right after the gift.

18
00:00:57.378 --> 00:00:59.638
Now tap "▶ Preview the whole bot".

19
00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:03.201
It plays by itself, and stops where they would answer.

20
00:01:03.331 --> 00:01:05.863
Type an answer, just like they would.

21
00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:18.384
Then tap "📲 Send a test to my Telegram", and answer like a real person would.

22
00:01:18.514 --> 00:01:20.294
Nothing is counted.

23
00:01:24.506 --> 00:01:25.891
Looks good?

24
00:01:26.021 --> 00:01:28.084
Save it, and switch it on.

25
00:01:33.222 --> 00:01:37.317
Last, tap "Copy the link", and put it in your ads and posts.
